# --- Interest profiles (THE product: these paragraphs drive all ranking) ---
# One free-text paragraph per lens. Generative-AI interest is expressed here,
# not as a separate bucket. Refine these carefully — ranking quality rides on them.
PROFILE_AIML="Efficient training and inference for large models: KV-cache tricks, quantization, sparsity/MoE, distillation, small models that match big ones, optimization and scaling laws, and reinforcement learning that actually ships."
PROFILE_NLP="Practical large language models: retrieval-augmented generation, long-context, agents and tool use, evaluation and hallucination, instruction tuning and preference optimization, and generative text systems that are reproducible."
PROFILE_CV="Generative vision: diffusion and flow models, text-to-image and text-to-video, controllable and 3D-aware generation, efficient samplers, and multimodal models bridging vision and language."

# --- Gemini (AI Studio free-tier key). If unset, summaries are written as null. ---
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# --- Sink: "local" writes JSON to ./output, "firestore" writes to Firestore ---
SINK=local
# For SINK=firestore:
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-project-id
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/service-account.json

# --- Tunables (defaults are sensible) ---
WINDOW_DAYS=7
TOP_K=3
ARXIV_PAGE_SIZE=100
ARXIV_THROTTLE_SECONDS=3
ARXIV_MAX_PAGES=10

